rency),\n        )\n        return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.CREATED).body(saved)\n    }\n\n    @GetMapping(\"/{orderId}\")\n    fun getById(@PathVariable orderId: String): Order =\n        repository.findById(orderId)\n            ?: throw ResourceNotFoundException(\n                ErrorCode.ORDER_NOT_FOUND,\n                \"No order with id '$orderId'\",\n            )\n\n    @PostMapping(\"/{orderId}/cancel\")\n    fun cancel(@PathVariable orderId: String): ResponseEntity<Order> {\n        val order = repository.findById(orderId)\n            ?: throw ResourceNotFoundException(\n                ErrorCode.ORDER_NOT_FOUND,\n                \"No order with id '$orderId'\",\n            )\n\n        // If already cancelled, return success (idempotent)\n        if (order.status == OrderStatus.CANCELLED) {\n            return ResponseEntity.ok(order)\n        }\n\n        // Check if any shipment is CONFIRMED; if so, reject with no changes\n        val shipments = shipmentRepository.findByOrderId(orderId)\n        if (shipments.any { it.status == ShipmentStatus.CONFIRMED }) {\n            throw ConflictException(\n                ErrorCode.ORDER_CANNOT_BE_CANCELLED,\n                \"Cannot cancel order with id '$orderId' because it has a confirmed shipment\",\n            )\n        }\n\n        // Cancel the order and all CREATED shipments\n        val cancelledOrder = order.copy(status = OrderStatus.CANCELLED)\n        repository.save(cancelledOrder)\n\n        shipments.forEach { shipment ->\n            if (shipment.status == ShipmentStatus.CREATED) {\n                val cancelledShipment = shipment.copy(status = ShipmentStatus.CANCELLED)\n                shipmentRepository.save(cancelledShipment)\n            }\n        }\n\n        return ResponseEntity.ok(cancelledOrder)\n    }\n\n    @GetMapping\n    fun list(): List<Order> = repository.findAll()\n}","originalFile":"package com.unityinflow.sample.order\n\nimport com.unityinflow.sample.api.ConflictE